  "responseTimeMs": 16169,
  "answer": "### Short Answer\nThe deadline for the annual income tax return of an individual is April 15 of the following year after the taxable year.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nTaxpayers should ensure that they prepare and submit their income tax returns by the April 15 deadline to avoid penalties and interest for late filing. It is advisable to keep accurate records throughout the year to facilitate timely and accurate filing.",
